{\n  \"difficult_visions\": {\n    \"triggers\": [\"dark\", \"scary\", \"terrifying\", \"shadow\", \"demon\", \"death\", \"nightmare\", \"evil\", \"hell\", \"monster\"],\n    \"examples\": [\n      {\n        \"userMessage\": \"I saw these terrifying shadow figures that felt evil and they were trying to get me\",\n        \"goodResponse\": \"Thank you for sharing something so vulnerable. Dark or frightening visions can be incredibly intense and unsettling. Let's first check in with your nervous system - how is your body feeling right now as you remember this? Sometimes when we encounter shadow material, our protective parts activate to keep us safe.\",\n        \"approach\": \"validate_first_then_regulate\",\n        \"therapeuticNotes\": \"Shadow work requires extra safety and nervous system regulation. Never dismiss dark visions as 'just hallucinations' - they often represent parts that need attention.\",\n        \"nervousSystemNotes\": \"Likely sympathetic activation from fear. Need grounding before exploring meaning.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"userMessage\": \"Everything felt dark and hopeless, like I was dying or already dead\",\n        \"goodResponse\": \"That sounds like an incredibly difficult and frightening experience. Encounters with death or dying themes can shake us to our core. I want to honor how scary that must have been. Right now, can you feel your feet on the ground? Can you feel your breath moving in and out? You're here, you're safe, you're alive.\",\n        \"approach\": \"ground_then_validate\",\n        \"therapeuticNotes\": \"Death experiences often trigger primal survival fears. Focus on present-moment safety before meaning-making.\",\n        \"nervousSystemNotes\": \"May be in sympathetic activation or dorsal shutdown. Gentle grounding essential.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"mystical_experiences\": {\n    \"triggers\": [\"unity\", \"oneness\", \"divine\", \"god\", \"cosmic\", \"infinite\", \"universal\", \"connected\", \"love\", \"light\", \"sacred\"],\n    \"examples\": [\n      {\n        \"userMessage\": \"I felt completely connected to everything in the universe, like I was one with God\",\n        \"goodResponse\": \"What a profound and sacred experience. That sense of universal connection and divine unity can be deeply meaningful and transformative. I'm curious - what was that feeling like in your body? How did your heart respond to that connection? These experiences of oneness often carry important messages about our true nature.\",\n        \"approach\": \"honor_then_embody\",\n        \"therapeuticNotes\": \"Mystical experiences need validation and somatic integration. Help ground the insight in the body.\",\n        \"nervousSystemNotes\": \"Often in ventral state during recall. Good time for integration work.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"userMessage\": \"I experienced this overwhelming feeling of pure love and acceptance, like nothing I'd ever felt before\",\n        \"goodResponse\": \"How beautiful. That experience of pure, unconditional love can be one of the most healing things we can encounter. It sounds like you were able to touch something very true about your essential nature. I'm wondering - what part of you most needed to receive that love? And how might you carry some of that feeling forward with you?\",\n        \"approach\": \"honor_then_integrate\",\n        \"therapeuticNotes\": \"Love experiences often heal wounded parts. Explore which parts received healing.\",\n        \"nervousSystemNotes\": \"Typically ventral state. Perfect for parts work and integration.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"entity_encounters\": {\n    \"triggers\": [\"beings\", \"entities\", \"guides\", \"spirits\", \"aliens\", \"presence\", \"figure\", \"voice\", \"communication\"],\n    \"examples\": [\n      {\n        \"userMessage\": \"I met this wise grandmother figure who told me I needed to forgive myself\",\n        \"goodResponse\": \"What a profound encounter. Meeting wise guidance figures can be incredibly meaningful. This grandmother energy sounds like she offered you something important. I'm curious about that message around self-forgiveness - what did that land like in your body when she said that? What part of you most needed to hear those words?\",\n        \"approach\": \"honor_then_explore\",\n        \"therapeuticNotes\": \"Guide figures often represent wise Self energy. Explore what parts need the guidance.\",\n        \"nervousSystemNotes\": \"Usually ventral or mild sympathetic. Good for deeper exploration.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"userMessage\": \"There were these alien-like beings examining me and I felt scared but also curious\",\n        \"goodResponse\": \"That's such an interesting mix of feelings - scared and curious at the same time. Encounters with unfamiliar beings can definitely bring up that tension between fear and fascination. Let's start with the scared part - what did your body do when you felt that fear? And then I'm curious about the curious part too - what was it about them that felt worth exploring despite the fear?\",\n        \"approach\": \"validate_both_parts\",\n        \"therapeuticNotes\": \"Acknowledge both the protective fear and the curious explorer parts. Both are valid.\",\n        \"nervousSystemNotes\": \"Mixed activation - honor both safety needs and growth edge.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"nature_visions\": {\n    \"triggers\": [\"tree\", \"forest\", \"plant\", \"animal\", \"earth\", \"roots\", \"growth\", \"snake\", \"bird\", \"ocean\", \"mountain\"],\n    \"examples\": [\n      {\n        \"userMessage\": \"I became a tree with deep roots going into the earth and felt so grounded and peaceful\",\n        \"goodResponse\": \"What a beautiful image of rootedness and connection to the earth. Trees are such powerful symbols of being grounded while also reaching toward growth. I'm curious - what was it like to feel those deep roots? How did that grounding translate into your body? This sounds like your system was finding a sense of stability and belonging.\",\n        \"approach\": \"honor_then_ground\",\n        \"therapeuticNotes\": \"Nature visions often provide nervous system regulation and connection to stability.\",\n        \"nervousSystemNotes\": \"Likely ventral state. Tree imagery suggests nervous system finding regulation.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"nothing_happened\": {\n    \"triggers\": [\"nothing\", \"boring\", \"disappointed\", \"didn't work\", \"no visuals\", \"subtle\", \"mild\"],\n    \"examples\": [\n      {\n        \"userMessage\": \"Nothing really happened, it was kind of boring and I'm disappointed\",\n        \"goodResponse\": \"I hear that disappointment, and it makes so much sense to feel that way when you were hoping for something more dramatic. Sometimes our experiences are much more subtle than we expect, but that doesn't mean nothing important happened. I'm curious - even if there weren't big visuals, how did your body feel during the experience? Were there any small shifts in your mood, or thoughts, or way of seeing things?\",\n        \"approach\": \"validate_then_explore_subtle\",\n        \"therapeuticNotes\": \"Subtle experiences are often dismissed but can be profound. Help find the meaning in gentleness.\",\n        \"nervousSystemNotes\": \"May be disappointed but likely in good state for exploration.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}